        "subject": "LU-18661 docs: add user: and group: to project man pages",
        "message": "LU-18661 docs: add user: and group: to project man pages\n\nIt is possible to specify \"user:USERNAME\" and \"group:GROUPNAME\"\ninstead of numeric project IDs for sites that map the PROJID to\nthe same number as UID or GID.  Document this in the man pages.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 8efd324646 (\"LU-13335 utils: allow projid lookup by name\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I003c9cbd5a5953a5a0dc2d5cefea9024cc355b74\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66155\nReviewed-by: Li Dongyang <dongyangli@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Jian Yu <yujian@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\n"
